NOTICE
======

teardown-codex is a Codex-side port of the Claude Code teardown skill, plus a
mechanical-ant example built with that port.

This repository is NOT an official Codex product or release, and is not
endorsed by OpenAI, Anthropic, elvarofficial, or whaleyxbt.

