  (MIT License; Copyright 2026 elvarofficial and whaleyxbt)

- Motion / film capture base:
  https://github.com/whaleyxbt/claude-motion
  (MIT License; Copyright 2026 whaleyxbt)

- Author article introducing the original skill:
  https://x.com/elvar_official/status/2116174609355571402

What this repo adds
-------------------
- Skill packaging and path adjustments so the same SKILL.md workflow can run
  under Codex.
- A mechanical-ant interactive offline demo (examples/ant/), including a
  single-file HTML build you can open in a browser.

Official upstream examples (V8, Cessna, Strandbeest) are intentionally NOT
vendored here. Build them from the upstream repo instead.
